00:13:24.150 --> 00:13:29.790
It's not like I'm actually enjoying seeing
such a shabby town being smashed up.

00:13:30.450 --> 00:13:33.370
Burning it down with a dragon would be more fun,

00:13:33.370 --> 00:13:36.040
but I've got strict orders from my father.

00:13:36.960 --> 00:13:40.510
The dragons are not yet used to how towns smell.

00:13:41.090 --> 00:13:43.170
Make sure they don't enter one.

00:13:43.170 --> 00:13:45.840
What?! Then there's no point in taking them!

00:13:45.840 --> 00:13:47.140
There <i>is</i> a point!

00:13:47.720 --> 00:13:50.350
You use dragons to intimidate them.

00:13:50.350 --> 00:13:52.470
This isn't about Alsace alone.

00:13:52.470 --> 00:13:54.770
It's a warning to the whole of Brune:

00:13:55.480 --> 00:14:00.020
"Standing against Thenardier is tantamount to suicide!"

00:14:00.610 --> 00:14:03.030
What? All the villagers have fled?!

00:14:03.360 --> 00:14:05.610
It appears some are hiding in the forest,

00:14:05.610 --> 00:14:08.280
and the others seem to have holed up inside the temple.

00:14:08.280 --> 00:14:09.780
What are your orders?

00:14:09.780 --> 00:14:11.870
The temple is off-limits.

00:14:11.870 --> 00:14:15.830
If we attack it, every other temple in Brune will turn against us.

00:14:15.830 --> 00:14:16.670
Leave them be!

00:14:25.760 --> 00:14:28.300
Vorn's mansion, huh?

00:14:36.100 --> 00:14:37.480
Lord Tigre...

00:14:44.990 --> 00:14:46.280
Protect me...

00:14:47.610 --> 00:14:50.200
Give me courage...

00:15:02.460 --> 00:15:03.590
Who are you?

00:15:05.960 --> 00:15:08.840
Now aren't you a pretty one?

00:15:09.510 --> 00:15:11.090
Please leave.

00:15:11.470 --> 00:15:12.720
Huh?

00:15:12.720 --> 00:15:15.020
I didn't quite catch that.

00:15:15.020 --> 00:15:19.020
Looks like that Vorn imbecile
can't even train his maids properly.

00:15:19.020 --> 00:15:22.020
Come on, say it again.

00:15:22.020 --> 00:15:23.230
Go away.

00:15:23.570 --> 00:15:24.650
What did you say?

00:15:28.030 --> 00:15:30.280
I told you to get out of here!

00:15:30.410 --> 00:15:35.620
This estate, and this town, belong to Lord Tigre!

00:15:34.910 --> 00:15:38.120
Don't you dare lay a finger on either!

00:15:37.410 --> 00:15:40.710
You heard me this time! Now get out!

00:15:40.710 --> 00:15:42.420
Get out!

00:16:01.940 --> 00:16:02.980
What's wrong?

00:16:03.480 --> 00:16:07.480
Start running, or I'll cut off a leg next.

00:16:14.280 --> 00:16:16.950
Are we done playing tag already?

00:16:32.630 --> 00:16:33.760
Lord Tigre...

00:16:34.840 --> 00:16:36.550
What's this now, girl?

00:16:36.550 --> 00:16:40.270
You, <i>a maid</i>, have feelings for your master?

00:16:40.270 --> 00:16:42.600
No, that's not true!

00:16:43.230 --> 00:16:44.520
<i>Lord Tigre...</i>

00:16:44.520 --> 00:16:49.110
That Vorn guy wasn't able to pay his ransom,

00:16:49.110 --> 00:16:52.740
so he's probably being sold
into slavery right about now.

00:16:52.740 --> 00:16:54.530
Should I do the same with you?

00:16:54.530 --> 00:16:57.700
If you're lucky, you could meet him again.

00:16:58.450 --> 00:17:00.330
You'll be fellow slaves.

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:02.460
You might have a chance with him then!

00:17:03.620 --> 00:17:04.830
Lord Tigre is...

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.460
Lord Tigre is coming back!

00:17:06.840 --> 00:17:08.960
You're such a brave girl.

00:17:17.390 --> 00:17:21.640
Don't worry. You can scream
his name all you want!

00:17:31.480 --> 00:17:32.900
<i>Lord Tigre...</i>

00:17:35.950 --> 00:17:36.870
Huh?

00:17:58.430 --> 00:18:00.560
Jump, Titta!

00:18:03.680 --> 00:18:04.560
Jump!

00:18:16.530 --> 00:18:17.410
Titta!

00:18:38.010 --> 00:18:38.970
What?

00:18:38.970 --> 00:18:41.430
You really <i>are</i> reckless. My goodness.

00:18:45.700 --> 00:18:47.990
I won't ask you to return the favor,

00:18:47.990 --> 00:18:50.650
but if I hadn't helped,
you would've been seriously injured.

00:18:51.540 --> 00:18:52.770
<i>A gale...</i>

00:18:52.770 --> 00:18:54.690
<i>So that's it. </i>

00:18:54.690 --> 00:18:55.860
<i>Her power...</i>

00:18:56.400 --> 00:18:59.450
Yes. This sword can control the wind.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:01.620
Only a war maiden can wield it.

00:19:02.080 --> 00:19:04.330
This is Arifar.

00:19:08.920 --> 00:19:11.920
Oh, I guess it likes you.

00:19:13.960 --> 00:19:14.800
Zion...

00:19:14.800 --> 00:19:16.380
Zion?

00:19:16.380 --> 00:19:19.720
The eldest son of House Thenardier, and its next head.

00:19:20.590 --> 00:19:22.180
He must be their commander.

00:19:22.510 --> 00:19:23.320
Forward!

00:19:23.320 --> 00:19:23.970
Sir!

00:19:23.970 --> 00:19:25.060
Lord Tigre!

00:19:25.770 --> 00:19:26.640
Titta...?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.230
Lord Tigre!

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:31.860
Come to think of it, why are you still here?

00:19:32.770 --> 00:19:34.150
Because...

00:19:34.150 --> 00:19:36.320
Because something might've happened,

00:19:36.320 --> 00:19:39.280
and I wanted to at least save the bow.

00:19:39.280 --> 00:19:40.280
You dummy!

00:19:40.280 --> 00:19:42.320
You should have left it here and saved yourself!

00:19:42.320 --> 00:19:44.910
I could never... do that!

00:19:44.910 --> 00:19:46.040
Titta...

00:19:46.040 --> 00:19:50.040
You entrusted me with watching over the estate in your absence, Lord Tigre!

00:19:50.040 --> 00:19:51.660
I couldn't possibly have run away!

00:19:52.410 --> 00:19:54.420
But I was scared...

00:19:55.170 --> 00:19:56.750
I was so scared...

00:19:57.840 --> 00:20:00.550
Lord Tigre, I believed in you.

00:20:01.720 --> 00:20:02.430
Thank you.

00:20:06.430 --> 00:20:08.600
I'm getting quite jealous.

00:20:08.600 --> 00:20:10.520
So that's your type, is it?

00:20:12.530 --> 00:20:15.650
Lord Tigre, who exactly are these people?

00:20:34.830 --> 00:20:35.630
Can you still fight?

00:20:36.000 --> 00:20:37.500
It's only a scratch. No problem.

00:20:38.800 --> 00:20:39.760
Zirnitras!

00:20:41.420 --> 00:20:42.340
Charge!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.060
Tigre, after them!

00:20:47.350 --> 00:20:48.430
Yeah!

00:20:50.060 --> 00:20:51.230
The bow!

00:20:53.120 --> 00:20:54.970
That must've been...

00:20:54.970 --> 00:20:56.150
Lord Tigre...

00:20:57.320 --> 00:20:58.900
Now's the time for this.

00:21:05.910 --> 00:21:10.120
Use this bow only when you absolutely have to.

00:21:11.040 --> 00:21:12.910
The time has come, hasn't it?

00:21:31.600 --> 00:21:33.560
We won't let a single one of them escape!

00:21:33.980 --> 00:21:36.060
Make sure they get their just deserts!

00:21:38.060 --> 00:21:41.820
Lord Urs, your son has finally taken up that bow.

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.360
The black bow.

00:21:55.000 --> 00:21:57.790
A black bow, handed down through the ages,

00:21:58.500 --> 00:22:02.710
will finally be wielded by the young Tigre as he heads for battle.

00:22:03.590 --> 00:22:06.680
Three thousand enemies. One thousand allies.

00:22:06.680 --> 00:22:09.300
How will this battle end?

00:22:10.470 --> 00:22:14.730
