00:22:21.980 --> 00:22:27.750
tooku omou mono wa

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:34.750
remain very much alive inside me.

00:22:28.930 --> 00:22:34.750
mune ni atsui kioku yo

00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:46.790
