00:22:36.050 --> 00:22:46.790
fui no kurai kizashi furiharau you ni

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:56.700
I direct the power that flows from my fingertips

00:22:47.350 --> 00:22:56.700
yubisaki e to minagiru chikara wo shinarase nagara

00:22:56.700 --> 00:23:04.520
fly like an arrow at the target in sight.

00:22:56.700 --> 00:23:04.520
ano mato wo nerai ko wo egake

